  m_text: '<size=26><b>BOMB DEFUSAL MANUAL</b></size>


    <b>1. WIRES</b>

    Look
    at the colored light on the wire module and cut ONLY ONE wire with the cutters:

    -
    <color=#C00000>RED</color> light: <b>BLUE</b> wire

    - <color=#1040C0>BLUE</color>
    light: <b>YELLOW</b> wire

    - <color=#108020>GREEN</color> light: <b>RED</b>
    wire'
