  m_text: '<b>2. FUSE</b>

    Look at the last digit of the serial number (SN):

    -
    0 to 3: <b>GREEN</b> fuse

    - 4 to 6: <b>ORANGE</b> fuse

    - 7 to 9: <b>PURPLE</b>
    fuse


    <b>3. KEYPAD</b>

    The 4 digit code is written on a note somewhere
    in the room. OK confirms, C clears.


    <b>3 mistakes = BOOM.</b>'
